1
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:14,441
Betrayal’s the only family I ever had…

2
00:00:14,121 --> 00:00:18,510
Brick by Brick, I built myself back.

3
00:00:21,702 --> 00:00:24,254
Smooth operator with your charming lies

4
00:00:25,371 --> 00:00:27,527
Playing victim while you victimize

5
00:00:28,164 --> 00:00:31,277
But every word you speak’s a double blade

6
00:00:31,435 --> 00:00:34,707
Now you’re trapped in webs that you have made

7
00:00:49,548 --> 00:00:52,261
Sweet poison dripping from your silver tongue

8
00:00:53,218 --> 00:00:55,691
Acting old but playing way too young

9
00:00:56,011 --> 00:00:59,121
I watched you rig the board, load the dice

10
00:00:59,281 --> 00:01:02,633
But I don’t pay the coward’s price

11
00:01:03,829 --> 00:01:05,903
You thought you had me figured out

12
00:01:10,531 --> 00:01:15,319
Watch me raise the city from the ashes now

13
00:01:17,073 --> 00:01:18,909
Razor wire, razor wire

14
00:01:20,426 --> 00:01:22,500
Tangled in your own desire

15
00:01:24,254 --> 00:01:25,850
Every cut you made on me

16
00:01:27,527 --> 00:01:29,441
Came back twice as deep

17
00:01:30,798 --> 00:01:32,712
Razor wire, razor wire

18
00:01:34,228 --> 00:01:36,382
Phoenix from a funeral fire

19
00:01:37,579 --> 00:01:40,531
I laid my past down, set it alight

20
00:01:41,090 --> 00:01:45,000
Then Brick by Brick I rose through the night

21
00:01:48,430 --> 00:01:50,745
Gaslighting master with a PhD

22
00:01:51,861 --> 00:01:54,415
In making others doubt what they see

23
00:01:54,894 --> 00:01:58,004
But mirrors don’t lie when they crack and break

24
00:01:58,084 --> 00:02:01,197
I’m the earthquake you didn’t anticipate

25
00:02:02,233 --> 00:02:04,867
Your little puppet strings don’t work on me

26
00:02:05,584 --> 00:02:08,217
I cut them off and set my spirit free

27
00:02:08,616 --> 00:02:12,048
No family, no friends, no backing required

28
00:02:12,048 --> 00:02:15,000
I’m self-made steel, pressure-forged, wired

29
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:19,706
You played with fire, now you’re burned

30
00:02:19,787 --> 00:02:21,383


31
00:02:23,217 --> 00:02:28,245
Some lessons only Phoenixes learn

32
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:32,473
Razor wire, razor wire

33
00:02:32,951 --> 00:02:36,063
Choking on your own desire

34
00:02:36,782 --> 00:02:39,495
Every game you tried to play

35
00:02:39,973 --> 00:02:41,649
Cuts you back the same

36
00:02:41,649 --> 00:02:45,638
Razor wire, razor wire

37
00:02:46,835 --> 00:02:48,830
Watch your cardboard throne expire

38
00:02:49,149 --> 00:02:49,787


39
00:02:50,346 --> 00:02:52,979
I don’t need a crown or a choir

40
00:02:53,616 --> 00:02:56,568
I’m Brick, I’m Forge, I’m Phoenix fire

41
00:03:17,552 --> 00:03:19,947
I thought love meant letting you win

42
00:03:20,984 --> 00:03:23,377
I thought peace meant swallowing sin

43
00:03:24,096 --> 00:03:25,212


44
00:03:25,770 --> 00:03:27,765
Boundaries aren’t walls to climb

45
00:03:27,925 --> 00:03:30,399
They’re the line between yours and mine

46
00:03:30,956 --> 00:03:32,153


47
00:03:33,191 --> 00:03:38,936
So here’s my boundary: STAY THE FUCK AWAY!

48
00:03:40,532 --> 00:03:42,366


49
00:03:42,366 --> 00:03:48,909
Razor wire, razor wire

50
00:03:48,909 --> 00:03:52,340
From rubble to a living throne

51
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:55,451
No allies, no ties, no grief

52
00:03:55,770 --> 00:03:58,644
I crowned myself with disbelief

53
00:03:59,282 --> 00:04:02,074
Razor wire, razor wire

54
00:04:02,793 --> 00:04:05,745
Phoenix-coded, Brick attire

55
00:04:06,063 --> 00:04:09,096
You left me nothing – that’s my gain

56
00:04:09,574 --> 00:04:13,403
I turn your knives to hurricane

57
00:04:13,644 --> 00:04:20,665
[Guitar feedback + metallic scraping]

58
00:04:13,644 --> 00:04:25,451
Brick by Brick…

59
00:04:24,653 --> 00:04:37,738
I rise… reborn in flame.
